  "prompt": "fx_rates_monthly holds one USD rate per month. For each month of 2025, show the rate and its 3-month moving average: the average eur_per_unit of that month and the 2 months before it, rounded to 4 decimals. Months follow each other by month. Only 2025's months count, so the first two months have fewer than 3 months to average: show how many months each average covers in months_in_window. Return four columns, in this order: month, eur_per_unit, avg_rate_3m and months_in_window. Return one row for each month of 2025 in fx_rates_monthly. Any row order is fine.",
